(61, 156, 'GUDS718267965926', 'Ummu', 'Abdul Basir  ', NULL, '2003-08-11', 'Female', 'Ghanaian', '0594637685', 'hummuabdul20@icloud.com', 'Kumasi ', 'Ashanti', 'Old Tafo Municipal', 'University for Development Studies', 'BED BASIC EDUCATION', '2026', 'Ashanti', 'Kumasi Metropolitan (Adum / Central)', NULL, NULL, '2026', '2026-10-05', '2027-10-05', 'passport/156-ummu-abdul-basir/1791460403817_3ce40955-bcea-4f16-b694-c5c5f03ef263.jpeg', 'id_card/156-ummu-abdul-basir/1791460404249_e461e8d1-3119-4695-a347-9c2c212ee31f.jpeg', 'appointment/156-ummu-abdul-basir/1791460405274_Ummu_NSS_Letter__compressed__1_.pdf', 'cv/156-ummu-abdul-basir/1791460405458_UMMU_CV.pdf', 'I want to undertake my National Service at the Driver and Vehicle Licensing Authority (DVLA), Kumasi, because I believe it will provide me with a valuable opportunity to gain practical workplace experience and develop my professional skills.\n\nDVLA is a public institution that plays an important role in driver licensing, vehicle registration, road safety, and public service delivery. \n\nI am particularly interested in improving my communication, customer service, teamwork, administrative, and organizational skills while learning how a public institution operates. I also believe working at DVLA will expose me to different people and real-life administrative processes, helping me become more confident, responsible, disciplined, and prepared for future employment.\n\nI have therefore chosen DVLA Kumasi because I believe the experience will contribute meaningfully to my personal and professional development while allowing me to serve the public and contribute positively to the organization.', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-08 11:53:25', '2026-10-08 11:53:25'),
