(141, 373, 'GUE720637912726', 'Isaac', 'Asare ', NULL, '1998-11-29', 'Male', 'Ghanaian', '0530139342', 'pixelsike222@gmail.com', 'Lowcost, Winneba near police station ', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', 'University of Education, Winneba', 'BSc Accounting Education', '2026', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', NULL, NULL, '2026', '2026-10-19', '2027-10-05', 'passport/373-isaac-asare/1791481260843_IMG_2371.JPG', 'id_card/373-isaac-asare/1791481261796_IMG_2261.jpeg', 'appointment/373-isaac-asare/1791481262544_ISAAC_ASARE_Posting_Letter__2_.pdf', 'cv/373-isaac-asare/1791481262703_ISAAC_ASARE_CV_.pdf', 'I see DVLA as a chance to learn how a public institution works. I want to understand how processes are managed, how revenue is accounted for, and how the organisation serves the public every day. As a teacher-trained accountant, I can also help explain procedures clearly to clients and colleagues.\nThrough my NSS year, I hope to build practical experience in public sector accounting and customer service, and I want to contribute by being punctual, accurate and willing to learn. I believe this will prepare me for a career in accounting and public administration, and it will let me serve my country in an institution that touches the lives of many Ghanaians.\nThank you. ', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-08 17:41:02', '2026-10-08 17:41:02'),
