(194, 282, 'GUE723625164826', 'Christiana ', 'Bonney', 'Tagoe', '2005-03-02', 'Female', 'Ghanaian', '0505524031', 'christianatagoebonney@gmail.com', 'CE-013-5892', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', 'University of Education, Winneba', 'BSc. Business Administration (Human Resource Management)', '2026', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', NULL, NULL, '2026', '2026-10-05', '2027-10-05', 'passport/282-christiana-tagoe-bonney/1791487453146_188bca1b-9e7b-4c5c-ae6c-e74efc47b4f6.JPG', 'id_card/282-christiana-tagoe-bonney/1791487453244_ECOWAS_ID_Card_2.pdf', 'appointment/282-christiana-tagoe-bonney/1791487454032_NSS_compressed.pdf', 'cv/282-christiana-tagoe-bonney/1791487454275_Christiana_Tagoe_Bonney_.pdf', 'I have been attached to the Driver and Vehicle Licensing Authority (DVLA) for the past two years. During my school vacations, I would regularly go to the DVLA to gain practical work experience. I later completed my internship there as part of my academic requirements, and I am also hoping to undertake my NSS at the same institution. During my time at DVLA, I worked mainly at the front desk, where I assisted customers with various licensing and vehicle registration services. My responsibilities included scanning documents, registering vehicles, processing new driving licences, Booking of registration cards and forms and assisting with licence registration and other related transactions. Through these experiences, I have gained practical knowledge of customer service, document processing, vehicle registration, licensing procedures, and working in a professional environment. My continuous experience at DVLA has also helped me become more familiar with the operations and services of the organisation', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-08 19:24:14', '2026-10-08 19:24:14'),
